ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhiwei and Xiaolan are planning a short trip, they are sitting on a park bench flipping through a travel guide. Mingda, although not invited to this short trip, still stands behind them listening to their discussion. Suddenly, Zhiwei notices Mingda on the side, and gives Xiaolan a glance. Then, Xiaolan sees Zhiwei's look, shakes her head, and continues to look down at the travel guide. Mingda sees this exchange of looks, and still stands in place.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiaolan look down at the travel guide?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiaolan hopes Zhiwei greets Mingda on her behalf.\nB. Xiaolan wants to find the information Zhiwei wants from the travel guide.\nC. Xiaolan finds a fun tourist spot and shares it with Zhiwei.\nD. Xiaolan indicates that they do not need to invite Mingda to join the plan.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694820529823703,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e22dd6006945d2801ae1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368045460,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a08673aa2a5b4a39a2b2b73faa499249"}